Privacy Policy for Pomodoro Pro

Last updated: June 13, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Pomodoro Pro ("the App", "we", "us", or "our") handles information when you use our mobile application. The App is developed and maintained by Prasad Balineni ("the Developer").

By downloading and using Pomodoro Pro, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

Summary

Pomodoro Pro is designed to work completely offline. We do not collect, store, transmit, sell, or share any personal information. All data created in the App stays on your device.

Information We Collect

We do not collect any personal information.

Pomodoro Pro does not require you to create an account, sign in, or provide any personal details such as your name, email address, phone number, or location.

Information Stored on Your Device

To provide its features, the App stores the following data locally on your device only. This information never leaves your device and is never sent to us or any third party:

- Timer settings — your focus, short break, and long break durations, long-break cadence, auto-start preferences, sound and vibration choices, theme, and other in-app settings.
- Tasks — any tasks you create, including their titles, estimated and completed Pomodoro counts, and completion status.
- Statistics — records of your completed focus sessions, daily goals, streaks, and related productivity history used to display your stats.

This data is stored using your device's local storage. You can permanently delete all of this data at any time by clearing the App's data in your device settings or by uninstalling the App.

Permissions

The App may request the following device permissions to function:

- Notifications — to display the live timer and alerts when a focus session or break ends. The App does not send marketing or promotional notifications.
- Foreground service / Run in background — to keep the timer counting accurately while the App is in the background or your screen is off.
- Vibration — to provide haptic feedback when a session ends, if enabled.

These permissions are used solely to deliver the App's core timer functionality. They are not used to collect or transmit any data.

Network and Internet Access

Pomodoro Pro functions entirely offline and does not require an internet connection to operate. The App does not transmit your data over the internet.

Third-Party Services

Pomodoro Pro does not integrate any third-party analytics, advertising, tracking, or data-collection services.

Children's Privacy

The App does not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under the age of 13. Because no data is collected or transmitted, the App is safe for users of all ages.

Data Security

Because all of your data is stored locally on your device and is never transmitted, the security of that data depends on the security of your device. We recommend protecting your device with a secure lock screen.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this policy. Continued use of the App after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.

